(6639742, 991844, 12611, '<td valign="top">This is a visual journey. What immediately pops into my mind is holding a camera at seat level in my favorite indian restaurant and snapping down the long, beautiful bench that runs the whole length of the dining room wall. The figure in the back is perfect, and the colors of yellow and purple create a good offset- they don''t blend or compliment the red- makes it nice.</td>', 'This is a visual journey. What immediately pops into my mind is holding a camera at seat level in my favorite indian restaurant and snapping down the long, beautiful bench that runs the whole length of the dining room wall. The figure in the back is perfect, and the colors of yellow and purple create a good offset- they don''t blend or compliment the red- makes it nice.', '2012-01-09 08:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
