(6640909, 991768, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. The pose of the arms, when coupled with her expression, looks a bit unnatural to me. An offer, as the outstreched arms might suggest, would work better if she was looking towards the camera. But her face suggests a reflessive pose, which perhaps would wwork better if the arms were not that outstretched, at least for me.</td>', 'I like the idea. The pose of the arms, when coupled with her expression, looks a bit unnatural to me. An offer, as the outstreched arms might suggest, would work better if she was looking towards the camera. But her face suggests a reflessive pose, which perhaps would wwork better if the arms were not that outstretched, at least for me.', '2012-01-10 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
