(6641929, 991670, 142451, '<td valign="top">Love the bright little girl and the lovely light shining on her face. The rails running off into the distance or coming towards her bring my focus to her. What a sweet young lady she is!!! Congratulations on a very fine study!!</td>', 'Love the bright little girl and the lovely light shining on her face. The rails running off into the distance or coming towards her bring my focus to her. What a sweet young lady she is!!! Congratulations on a very fine study!!', '2012-01-11 07:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641953, 991869, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity, I''d like to see more contrast though... and maybe more outward lean on the pencil. It''s only slightly blurry, which is reminiscent of motion blur rather than shallow DoF. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like the simplicity, I''d like to see more contrast though... and maybe more outward lean on the pencil. It''s only slightly blurry, which is reminiscent of motion blur rather than shallow DoF. Nice photo.', '2012-01-11 08:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641957, 991599, 69446, '<td valign="top">Your image is oversaturated for my tastes, it''s hard for me to see the shallow DoF through all that overpowering red!</td>', 'Your image is oversaturated for my tastes, it''s hard for me to see the shallow DoF through all that overpowering red!', '2012-01-11 08:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641958, 991446, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and the composition... the shadow from the plate is a bit distracting though. I''m also wondering if a slight crop of the right edge would place the ends of the chopsticks on the magic "thirds" line. Nice photo.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and the composition... the shadow from the plate is a bit distracting though. I''m also wondering if a slight crop of the right edge would place the ends of the chopsticks on the magic "thirds" line. Nice photo.', '2012-01-11 08:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641959, 991465, 69446, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I can almost taste them. The lighting is a little muddy and the green stems in the centre make the photo a little busy for my tastes, but overall good work.</td>', 'Nice photo, I can almost taste them. The lighting is a little muddy and the green stems in the centre make the photo a little busy for my tastes, but overall good work.', '2012-01-11 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641962, 991244, 69446, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, a little too saturated for my tastes but still a nice photo, well done. Lovely bokeh by the way, I''ll be interested to see what lens/aperture was used :)</td>', 'Nice capture, a little too saturated for my tastes but still a nice photo, well done. Lovely bokeh by the way, I''ll be interested to see what lens/aperture was used :)', '2012-01-11 08:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641963, 991249, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like dark and moody images, but the lighting is a bit muddy and directionless for my tastes here.</td>', 'I like dark and moody images, but the lighting is a bit muddy and directionless for my tastes here.', '2012-01-11 08:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641968, 991921, 69446, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to go with a black background; personally, it doesn''t appeal to me, but well done for trying something different!</td>', 'Interesting choice to go with a black background; personally, it doesn''t appeal to me, but well done for trying something different!', '2012-01-11 08:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641969, 991315, 69446, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation to have the subject non-red... I''ll be interested to see how this one scores. Personally, I like it. 7 from me.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation to have the subject non-red... I''ll be interested to see how this one scores. Personally, I like it. 7 from me.', '2012-01-11 08:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641970, 991639, 69446, '<td valign="top">My problem with this shot is the depth of field isn''t shallow enough; more than half the image is in reasonably sharp focus. Did you shoot at the maximum aperture and zoom range of your lens?</td>', 'My problem with this shot is the depth of field isn''t shallow enough; more than half the image is in reasonably sharp focus. Did you shoot at the maximum aperture and zoom range of your lens?', '2012-01-11 08:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641971, 991737, 69446, '<td valign="top">Nice image, I like the simplicity and mood. Seven.</td>', 'Nice image, I like the simplicity and mood. Seven.', '2012-01-11 08:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641973, 991899, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, well done.</td>', 'I like the composition, well done.', '2012-01-11 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641974, 991403, 69446, '<td valign="top">Lovely image... you lose a point because it''s hard to really say how shallow (or not) the DoF is. The background could be miles away and the DoF quite generous. Challenge theme aside, a delicious photo.. well done.</td>', 'Lovely image... you lose a point because it''s hard to really say how shallow (or not) the DoF is. The background could be miles away and the DoF quite generous. Challenge theme aside, a delicious photo.. well done.', '2012-01-11 08:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641975, 990936, 69446, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, it''s begging for a funny caption though ("Who''s the boss?" or some such.) Well done.</td>', 'I really like this photo, it''s begging for a funny caption though ("Who''s the boss?" or some such.) Well done.', '2012-01-11 08:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641976, 991874, 69446, '<td valign="top">Extremely bold to submit a B&amp;W image (I''m assuming it''s just the red channel). I like it... 9 from me :)</td>', 'Extremely bold to submit a B&W image (I''m assuming it''s just the red channel). I like it... 9 from me :)', '2012-01-11 08:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641977, 991238, 69446, '<td valign="top">Ha, they look just like christmas decorations from the December challenge :)</td>', 'Ha, they look just like christmas decorations from the December challenge :)', '2012-01-11 08:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641978, 991775, 69446, '<td valign="top">I find the haloing around the lolly packet a bit off putting, but I like the colour palette and the reflective surface. Well done.</td>', 'I find the haloing around the lolly packet a bit off putting, but I like the colour palette and the reflective surface. Well done.', '2012-01-11 08:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641981, 991833, 69446, '<td valign="top">Most of the problems with this shot are technical... high noise and quite generous DoF, which I put down to limitations of the camera. The pink blotches on the bark are a bit distracting too, not sure if they are intentional or formed part of the original image but they look like processing artefacts. Happy looking critter though :)</td>', 'Most of the problems with this shot are technical... high noise and quite generous DoF, which I put down to limitations of the camera. The pink blotches on the bark are a bit distracting too, not sure if they are intentional or formed part of the original image but they look like processing artefacts. Happy looking critter though :)', '2012-01-11 08:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641983, 991881, 69446, '<td valign="top">Superb angle, unfortunately the subject is just blurred enough that I found it difficult to see clearly what I was looking at. Love the concept... perhaps need to desaturate the reds just a tad, they''re a bit overblown. Nice work.</td>', 'Superb angle, unfortunately the subject is just blurred enough that I found it difficult to see clearly what I was looking at. Love the concept... perhaps need to desaturate the reds just a tad, they''re a bit overblown. Nice work.', '2012-01-11 08:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641984, 990941, 69446, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, nice composition and execution. 7.</td>', 'Lovely image, nice composition and execution. 7.', '2012-01-11 08:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641985, 991447, 69446, '<td valign="top">Sublime photo, lovely pose with the eyes closed. The red is a little oversaturated for my taste but still a great image. 9 from me.</td>', 'Sublime photo, lovely pose with the eyes closed. The red is a little oversaturated for my taste but still a great image. 9 from me.', '2012-01-11 08:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641987, 991198, 69446, '<td valign="top">Cheeky (literally!)  My only criticism is the lighting, it''s a little murky and directionless - subjective (I tend to like stronger shadows, particularly for studies like this one). Nice overall, well done.</td>', 'Cheeky (literally!)  My only criticism is the lighting, it''s a little murky and directionless - subjective (I tend to like stronger shadows, particularly for studies like this one). Nice overall, well done.', '2012-01-11 08:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641988, 991449, 69446, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure where the caption came from, but I like it. If you twist your head to the left it looks like one of those gowns that the flamenco dancers wear in south america. Nice one.</td>', 'I''m not sure where the caption came from, but I like it. If you twist your head to the left it looks like one of those gowns that the flamenco dancers wear in south america. Nice one.', '2012-01-11 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641989, 991624, 69446, '<td valign="top">I love the image; perhaps feels a tiny bit shoe-horned into the theme by placing a red background on a non-red composition. Still, I love macro shots and this one is above average. Well done overall.</td>', 'I love the image; perhaps feels a tiny bit shoe-horned into the theme by placing a red background on a non-red composition. Still, I love macro shots and this one is above average. Well done overall.', '2012-01-11 08:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641990, 991299, 69446, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and I think the border works well for this shot. It''s begging for a funny caption ("Seeing around corners" or some such.) Well done.</td>', 'I like the composition and I think the border works well for this shot. It''s begging for a funny caption ("Seeing around corners" or some such.) Well done.', '2012-01-11 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641991, 991726, 69446, '<td valign="top">Good caption, overall the image is less than 20% red but I still like it. Well done.</td>', 'Good caption, overall the image is less than 20% red but I still like it. Well done.', '2012-01-11 08:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641992, 991181, 69446, '<td valign="top">Nothing wrong with your lighting or composition, overall a little bland as a subject... it didn''t grab my attention as something exciting to look at. A 5 from me, sorry! :-S</td>', 'Nothing wrong with your lighting or composition, overall a little bland as a subject... it didn''t grab my attention as something exciting to look at. A 5 from me, sorry! :-S', '2012-01-11 08:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6641993, 991922, 69446, '<td valign="top">Lovely... the skin tone looks a little bit blurred/strange, but full marks for a strong composition. Well done.</td>', 'Lovely... the skin tone looks a little bit blurred/strange, but full marks for a strong composition. Well done.', '2012-01-11 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642003, 991859, 69446, '<td valign="top">Interesting image... it''s not overwhelmed by red like many of the entries. DoF isn''t *that* shallow, but shallow enough. I like it. Well done.</td>', 'Interesting image... it''s not overwhelmed by red like many of the entries. DoF isn''t *that* shallow, but shallow enough. I like it. Well done.', '2012-01-11 11:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642006, 991466, 69446, '<td valign="top">Wow, déjà vu.. there''s another entry very similar to this one. Nice composition, the reds aren''t oversaturated like many of the other entries and I like the diagonal lines. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, déjà vu.. there''s another entry very similar to this one. Nice composition, the reds aren''t oversaturated like many of the other entries and I like the diagonal lines. Well done.', '2012-01-11 11:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
