(6642062, 991923, 69446, '<td valign="top">Intriguing idea... a redder nose would help, it''s really pink on my screen (calibrated) and that may cost you some points. I like your use of selective B&amp;W in the viewfinder, contrasting with the rest of the image. Well done.</td>', 'Intriguing idea... a redder nose would help, it''s really pink on my screen (calibrated) and that may cost you some points. I like your use of selective B&W in the viewfinder, contrasting with the rest of the image. Well done.', '2012-01-11 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
