(6642725, 991191, 140305, '<td valign="top">wow, I think this is a really lovely photo. Love the colors &amp; the lighting.</td>', 'wow, I think this is a really lovely photo. Love the colors & the lighting.', '2012-01-11 21:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642732, 991275, 140305, '<td valign="top">That is a really creative shot. Cudos to you for coming up with smething so imaginitive (and cool).</td>', 'That is a really creative shot. Cudos to you for coming up with smething so imaginitive (and cool).', '2012-01-11 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642736, 991743, 140305, '<td valign="top">I want to eat these, they look so good! Nice shot.</td>', 'I want to eat these, they look so good! Nice shot.', '2012-01-11 21:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642739, 991134, 140305, '<td valign="top">this is a really pretty shot. Love the colors.</td>', 'this is a really pretty shot. Love the colors.', '2012-01-11 22:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642742, 991844, 140305, '<td valign="top">I like the skewed angle and all the textures. Nice job!</td>', 'I like the skewed angle and all the textures. Nice job!', '2012-01-11 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642749, 991707, 140305, '<td valign="top">I am not sure how to score this because IMHO I would not call red the primary color, but it is certainly very prominent....having said that, I still really like the emotion this image creates.</td>', 'I am not sure how to score this because IMHO I would not call red the primary color, but it is certainly very prominent....having said that, I still really like the emotion this image creates.', '2012-01-11 22:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642758, 991748, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice depth of field.  I like the stars on the bottle :)  I wish whatever that is in the upper left wasn''t there - is that the reason for the title?  In the top 25% for me.</td>', 'Very nice depth of field.  I like the stars on the bottle :)  I wish whatever that is in the upper left wasn''t there - is that the reason for the title?  In the top 25% for me.', '2012-01-11 22:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642806, 991833, 138630, '<td valign="top">Birds are so difficult to capture well.  It''s nice that the cardinal is sharper than the branches but it''s not sharp enough and the background is very grainy.</td>', 'Birds are so difficult to capture well.  It''s nice that the cardinal is sharper than the branches but it''s not sharp enough and the background is very grainy.', '2012-01-11 22:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642807, 991488, 138630, '<td valign="top">You need the selective color to meet the challenge and it does help separate the rose from the background, but this photo is quite a bit too busy for me and the background highlights are blown out.</td>', 'You need the selective color to meet the challenge and it does help separate the rose from the background, but this photo is quite a bit too busy for me and the background highlights are blown out.', '2012-01-11 22:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642808, 991272, 138630, '<td valign="top">I find the red bizarre in this one which I guess fits the shot.  Not at all my style.</td>', 'I find the red bizarre in this one which I guess fits the shot.  Not at all my style.', '2012-01-11 22:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642809, 990946, 138630, '<td valign="top">Raspberries are red.  I don''t see the need for the light bulb.  I would have preferred a macro of a raspberry.  The shallow dof for effect is not obvious to me, either.</td>', 'Raspberries are red.  I don''t see the need for the light bulb.  I would have preferred a macro of a raspberry.  The shallow dof for effect is not obvious to me, either.', '2012-01-11 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642810, 991249, 138630, '<td valign="top">The front die looks to be in focus and the lighting is red so it fits the challenge.  This is an interesting idea that does not appeal to me.</td>', 'The front die looks to be in focus and the lighting is red so it fits the challenge.  This is an interesting idea that does not appeal to me.', '2012-01-11 23:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642812, 991896, 138630, '<td valign="top">Too dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Too dark on my monitor.', '2012-01-11 23:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642825, 991670, 45672, '<td valign="top">This one is just adorable.  Reminds me of my daughter.  What a terrific shot.  I hope you win a ribbon with this one.</td>', 'This one is just adorable.  Reminds me of my daughter.  What a terrific shot.  I hope you win a ribbon with this one.', '2012-01-11 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642830, 990919, 54645, '<td valign="top">Now this speaks to me.  I like your compositional choices, displaying the bike, rendering the key detail in focus. Good stuff, but the magic is in the bokeh. Soft, faded textures. . . a rusted chain. . . warm light. I can feel it. Well done.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-16 03:18:23.</i></td>', 'Now this speaks to me.  I like your compositional choices, displaying the bike, rendering the key detail in focus. Good stuff, but the magic is in the bokeh. Soft, faded textures. . . a rusted chain. . . warm light. I can feel it. Well done. ', '2012-01-11 23:49:53.000000', '2012-01-16 03:18:23.000000', 1),
(6642832, 991848, 54645, '<td valign="top">Yet not an alternate on the selective desat.</td>', 'Yet not an alternate on the selective desat.', '2012-01-11 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642833, 991865, 54645, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous bokeh and composition.</td>', 'Gorgeous bokeh and composition.', '2012-01-11 23:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642835, 991707, 54645, '<td valign="top">Thought provoking. Well done.</td>', 'Thought provoking. Well done.', '2012-01-11 23:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6642836, 991466, 54645, '<td valign="top">Beautiful creature</td>', 'Beautiful creature', '2012-01-11 23:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643011, 991298, 138630, '<td valign="top">So hard to get good exposure and detail on a black and white animal.  Though the moment captured is good and the selective color an excellent choice, I find this much to difficult to work out and I''m not really seeing much use of shallow dof, either.</td>', 'So hard to get good exposure and detail on a black and white animal.  Though the moment captured is good and the selective color an excellent choice, I find this much to difficult to work out and I''m not really seeing much use of shallow dof, either.', '2012-01-12 09:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643023, 991645, 138630, '<td valign="top">I think you sliced this strawberry but because of the softness, it just looks a bit deformed.  I also think the tones of the background are not that appetizing.</td>', 'I think you sliced this strawberry but because of the softness, it just looks a bit deformed.  I also think the tones of the background are not that appetizing.', '2012-01-12 10:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643025, 991921, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is very dark on my monitor and the center detail which I am sure is very nice is all but lost.  Not much in the way of selective focus, either, except the stem.  Red and black are good together so the background choice is good imo.</td>', 'This is very dark on my monitor and the center detail which I am sure is very nice is all but lost.  Not much in the way of selective focus, either, except the stem.  Red and black are good together so the background choice is good imo.', '2012-01-12 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643028, 991818, 138630, '<td valign="top">Pomegranate seeds?  Makes a kind of interesting abstract but there is no really sharp area to draw me in.  While I don''t usually need a frame, I like it here.</td>', 'Pomegranate seeds?  Makes a kind of interesting abstract but there is no really sharp area to draw me in.  While I don''t usually need a frame, I like it here.', '2012-01-12 10:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643040, 991743, 138630, '<td valign="top">I would like to see an area of excellent, sharp focus and more contrast between the sharp and soft areas.  Interesting that the green tops, now black, were left on during the cooking process.  For me a food shot should be appetizing and this one is not particularly.</td>', 'I would like to see an area of excellent, sharp focus and more contrast between the sharp and soft areas.  Interesting that the green tops, now black, were left on during the cooking process.  For me a food shot should be appetizing and this one is not particularly.', '2012-01-12 10:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643043, 991874, 138630, '<td valign="top">Having trouble with the "red" part here though since I know a RadioFlyer wagon is red, I''m using my imagination.  Maybe I''m just too literal minded LOL</td>', 'Having trouble with the "red" part here though since I know a RadioFlyer wagon is red, I''m using my imagination.  Maybe I''m just too literal minded LOL', '2012-01-12 10:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643045, 991745, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the title and tones and usually like this sort of shot.  I think the background could have been even softer or maybe just less busy -- maybe if you had been able to pull this branch forward from it a bit?  I also think taking maybe 1/4 to 1/3 off the top would have helped focus our attention on the subject.</td>', 'I like the title and tones and usually like this sort of shot.  I think the background could have been even softer or maybe just less busy -- maybe if you had been able to pull this branch forward from it a bit?  I also think taking maybe 1/4 to 1/3 off the top would have helped focus our attention on the subject.', '2012-01-12 10:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643049, 991834, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, composition, and idea of this very much -- focusing on the red stitches and picking up that color in the background was a good idea.  I do not care for the processing -- very overdone or over-sharpened or something.</td>', 'I like the perspective, composition, and idea of this very much -- focusing on the red stitches and picking up that color in the background was a good idea.  I do not care for the processing -- very overdone or over-sharpened or something.', '2012-01-12 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643165, 991865, 124190, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2012-01-12 12:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643168, 991874, 124190, '<td valign="top">......A.......+</td>', '......A.......+', '2012-01-12 12:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643170, 991878, 124190, '<td valign="top">I say......I will bite into one...NOW!!!!   YUM</td>', 'I say......I will bite into one...NOW!!!!   YUM', '2012-01-12 12:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643173, 991920, 124190, '<td valign="top">when I scrolled down to comment the Mmmmmeeeesssss followed me.......lolol.</td>', 'when I scrolled down to comment the Mmmmmeeeesssss followed me.......lolol.', '2012-01-12 12:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643175, 991728, 124190, '<td valign="top">No thanks......but I am sure my neighbor would LOVE to!   Why don''t you go over there!  I will call her RIGHT now to tell her you are on your way!   Ciao!</td>', 'No thanks......but I am sure my neighbor would LOVE to!   Why don''t you go over there!  I will call her RIGHT now to tell her you are on your way!   Ciao!', '2012-01-12 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643178, 991692, 124190, '<td valign="top">you are sooooo pretty!  you look perky and smily! Best shot in the bunch. 10</td>', 'you are sooooo pretty!  you look perky and smily! Best shot in the bunch. 10', '2012-01-12 12:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643180, 991743, 124190, '<td valign="top">ok...that''s just not fair....you just HAD to go and make me like THESE tomatoes the best.</td>', 'ok...that''s just not fair....you just HAD to go and make me like THESE tomatoes the best.', '2012-01-12 12:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643182, 991904, 124190, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Just the right amount of red, interesting and holds my attention....love the variations of red and I am relieved to see something that fits the challenge in a sophisticated and thought provoking manner.  10</td>', 'Lovely.  Just the right amount of red, interesting and holds my attention....love the variations of red and I am relieved to see something that fits the challenge in a sophisticated and thought provoking manner.  10', '2012-01-12 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643183, 991466, 124190, '<td valign="top">ooooooooo what a chubby little fellow!     Favorite cardinal in the bunch!</td>', 'ooooooooo what a chubby little fellow!     Favorite cardinal in the bunch!', '2012-01-12 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643189, 991298, 124190, '<td valign="top">At first I wondered why the cherry tomato was talking to a fuzzy mushroom.....THENNNNNN   I saw the whiskers!</td>', 'At first I wondered why the cherry tomato was talking to a fuzzy mushroom.....THENNNNNN   I saw the whiskers!', '2012-01-12 13:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643190, 991450, 124190, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2012-01-12 13:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643192, 990936, 124190, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.....a relief to see the reds on a light ground....nice composition which leads my eye from the front berry up the edge of the pom......good negative space.......super shot.  I''d say perfect.</td>', 'Nice lighting.....a relief to see the reds on a light ground....nice composition which leads my eye from the front berry up the edge of the pom......good negative space.......super shot.  I''d say perfect.', '2012-01-12 13:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643193, 991134, 124190, '<td valign="top">Splendid background makes this ethereal and appealing.........super dreamy. 10</td>', 'Splendid background makes this ethereal and appealing.........super dreamy. 10', '2012-01-12 13:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643194, 991474, 124190, '<td valign="top">A welcome relief from the crowd.....soothing...inviting.....I want this.   Best shot in the challenge.</td>', 'A welcome relief from the crowd.....soothing...inviting.....I want this.   Best shot in the challenge.', '2012-01-12 13:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643207, 991597, 142815, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective and the stark contrast between the ribbon and the tree.</td>', 'Love the perspective and the stark contrast between the ribbon and the tree.', '2012-01-12 13:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643208, 991670, 70265, '<td valign="top">This is adorable.</td>', 'This is adorable.', '2012-01-12 13:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643209, 991878, 142815, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting.</td>', 'Great focus and lighting.', '2012-01-12 13:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643210, 991848, 142815, '<td valign="top">Evocative shot. Works really well with the black/white background</td>', 'Evocative shot. Works really well with the black/white background', '2012-01-12 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643211, 991874, 142815, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get this but this could be due to inexperience.</td>', 'Not sure I get this but this could be due to inexperience.', '2012-01-12 13:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643213, 991894, 142815, '<td valign="top">Great details on the petals. Although unusual in my opinion, the red background compliments the flowers really well.</td>', 'Great details on the petals. Although unusual in my opinion, the red background compliments the flowers really well.', '2012-01-12 13:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643217, 991645, 142815, '<td valign="top">You can almost taste how sweet and juicy those strawberries are.</td>', 'You can almost taste how sweet and juicy those strawberries are.', '2012-01-12 13:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643219, 991875, 142815, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the yellow and red and the reflection in the droplets is really cool.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the yellow and red and the reflection in the droplets is really cool.', '2012-01-12 13:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643221, 991843, 142815, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity and details in the water</td>', 'Love the clarity and details in the water', '2012-01-12 13:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643223, 991403, 142815, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast. Great detail in the leaf and droplets.</td>', 'Love the contrast. Great detail in the leaf and droplets.', '2012-01-12 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643225, 991748, 142815, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the bottle but don''t really get the significance of the shot.</td>', 'Nice focus on the bottle but don''t really get the significance of the shot.', '2012-01-12 13:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643297, 991705, 138630, '<td valign="top">Is this some kind of amoeba or jellyfish?  Looks as if it was hard to capture.  Could you crop most of the thing in the lower left out and then burn out the bit of rim that''s left?  I think the other shape is strong enough to carry the frame.</td>', 'Is this some kind of amoeba or jellyfish?  Looks as if it was hard to capture.  Could you crop most of the thing in the lower left out and then burn out the bit of rim that''s left?  I think the other shape is strong enough to carry the frame.', '2012-01-12 16:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643298, 991611, 138630, '<td valign="top">Old bottles, I think?  I''m not crazy about the dark, murky colors.</td>', 'Old bottles, I think?  I''m not crazy about the dark, murky colors.', '2012-01-12 16:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643300, 991782, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very bright for sure.  The sharpest areas need to be much sharper.</td>', 'Very bright for sure.  The sharpest areas need to be much sharper.', '2012-01-12 16:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643335, 991796, 49018, '<td valign="top">Red fluid on pink floyd :)</td>', 'Red fluid on pink floyd :)', '2012-01-12 17:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643444, 991660, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity, color and focus.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Wonderful clarity, color and focus.  One of my top picks.', '2012-01-12 19:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643447, 991474, 138630, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and taken.  Love the steam.  One of my top picks.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and taken.  Love the steam.  One of my top picks.', '2012-01-12 19:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643448, 991859, 138630, '<td valign="top">Really like the set-up, the shriveled pomegranate, the selective color (may be natural as I see some aqua in the background), the simplicity of the composition.  The fruit is very centered, but I don''t see another crop for this shot that I would like better.  This will score well for me.</td>', 'Really like the set-up, the shriveled pomegranate, the selective color (may be natural as I see some aqua in the background), the simplicity of the composition.  The fruit is very centered, but I don''t see another crop for this shot that I would like better.  This will score well for me.', '2012-01-12 19:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643450, 991670, 138630, '<td valign="top">Such a cutie and the focus is perfect.  Love all the red touches in her outfit -- the white shirt and tights keep it from being too much.  I might have liked it better if she was looking at the camera but that doesn''t keep it from being a top pick.</td>', 'Such a cutie and the focus is perfect.  Love all the red touches in her outfit -- the white shirt and tights keep it from being too much.  I might have liked it better if she was looking at the camera but that doesn''t keep it from being a top pick.', '2012-01-12 19:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6643594, 991275, 138630, '<td valign="top">Red it is and the depth of field certainly defines this bold image.  I like it.</td>', 'Red it is and the depth of field certainly defines this bold image.  I like it.', '2012-01-12 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
