(6644245, 991414, 138630, '<td valign="top">I like the dof a lot here and this gets a nice score from me.  Can''t help feeling there''s a story here and I would like to know more about it.</td>', 'I like the dof a lot here and this gets a nice score from me.  Can''t help feeling there''s a story here and I would like to know more about it.', '2012-01-13 11:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644248, 991466, 138630, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus and detail on the cardinal -- so lovely of them to hang around for winter pics as they are so showy against the often neutral backgrounds of that season.  I find the two right to left golden diagonals distracting but I also know you have little to no control over stuff in the way of a capture like this.  Good image imo.</td>', 'Very nice focus and detail on the cardinal -- so lovely of them to hang around for winter pics as they are so showy against the often neutral backgrounds of that season.  I find the two right to left golden diagonals distracting but I also know you have little to no control over stuff in the way of a capture like this.  Good image imo.', '2012-01-13 12:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644250, 991899, 138630, '<td valign="top">I really like this -- like especially the fact that you show the scissors cutting.  The very sharpest focus seems to be on the edge of cut fabric at the top -- I would love it to be on the scissor handles which are slightly soft imo (though that could suggest motion so I don''t know . . . ).  Nice entry.</td>', 'I really like this -- like especially the fact that you show the scissors cutting.  The very sharpest focus seems to be on the edge of cut fabric at the top -- I would love it to be on the scissor handles which are slightly soft imo (though that could suggest motion so I don''t know . . . ).  Nice entry.', '2012-01-13 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644253, 991446, 138630, '<td valign="top">Interesting, pretty, red, and tack sharp where it should be.  Nice almost abstract.  I can see this framed in an oriental restaurant or a dining room with an oriental decor.</td>', 'Interesting, pretty, red, and tack sharp where it should be.  Nice almost abstract.  I can see this framed in an oriental restaurant or a dining room with an oriental decor.', '2012-01-13 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644266, 991904, 138630, '<td valign="top">What I especially like about this one is the background that really suggests the event and keeps this from being static.  The burning flame is a nice touch and though I can''t really make them out, I have a sense that there are people moving back there, too.  Very nice perspective.</td>', 'What I especially like about this one is the background that really suggests the event and keeps this from being static.  The burning flame is a nice touch and though I can''t really make them out, I have a sense that there are people moving back there, too.  Very nice perspective.', '2012-01-13 12:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6644341, 991725, 138630, '<td valign="top">I think the set-up and technique work perfectly together -- title is just right.  I wish the moon wasn''t there and I also think the brightness of her dress is overpowering but as you are working with red on red, I see that it works for separation purposes.  Good score from me.</td>', 'I think the set-up and technique work perfectly together -- title is just right.  I wish the moon wasn''t there and I also think the brightness of her dress is overpowering but as you are working with red on red, I see that it works for separation purposes.  Good score from me.', '2012-01-13 14:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
