(6645670, 991865, 97225, '<td valign="top">It sort of reminds me of washing on a line, but that analogy does not do it justice, because it a lovely and delicate image. In my top lineup at the moment. 9</td>', 'It sort of reminds me of washing on a line, but that analogy does not do it justice, because it a lovely and delicate image. In my top lineup at the moment. 9', '2012-01-15 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
