(6645980, 991474, 96530, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first blue with an awesome shot Doc!</td>', 'Congrats on your first blue with an awesome shot Doc!', '2012-01-16 00:26:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6645984, 991874, 113142, '<td valign="top">In a "Calvin and Hobbes" cartoon, Calvin asks his dad about b+w pictures. Dad tells him that the world used to be black and white. When confronted with the fact that the b+w pictures didn''t change with the rest of the world, Dad replies "that''s because they were color pictures of a black and white world." This was great, forces us to think about what color is and means.</td>', 'In a "Calvin and Hobbes" cartoon, Calvin asks his dad about b+w pictures. Dad tells him that the world used to be black and white. When confronted with the fact that the b+w pictures didn''t change with the rest of the world, Dad replies "that''s because they were color pictures of a black and white world." This was great, forces us to think about what color is and means.', '2012-01-16 00:27:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6645992, 991488, 113142, '<td valign="top">I love the way the flower doesn''t "face" us, almost seems haughty/pouty and I can imagine a little "hmph" at the end of your title :)</td>', 'I love the way the flower doesn''t "face" us, almost seems haughty/pouty and I can imagine a little "hmph" at the end of your title :)', '2012-01-16 00:30:56.000000', NULL, 0),
