(6646043, 991874, 142483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vlado:</b></div><hr/><i>The ability to convey red in an image, as you have, without actually relying on the colour... wow!  Brilliant! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Being 23 years old and from Australia, I had no idea what this image was of, and that it is typically a red object, but submitted in black and white. After reading the other comments, I still stand by the low score I gave this, as I didn''t get any "red" from this, which is what the challenge asks for. Wrong audience, I guess :)</td>', 'Originally posted by vlado:The ability to convey red in an image, as you have, without actually relying on the colour... wow!  Brilliant!   Being 23 years old and from Australia, I had no idea what this image was of, and that it is typically a red object, but submitted in black and white. After reading the other comments, I still stand by the low score I gave this, as I didn''t get any "red" from this, which is what the challenge asks for. Wrong audience, I guess :)', '2012-01-16 00:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
