(6646161, 991447, 138721, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the votes and great comments!!<br/>I''m glad you liked the photo<br/>The score really started like a rocket, clearly above 7<br/>Later went down... later up again... finally down<br/>At some moment I felt like watching some stock quotation!<br/>This is my best score so far, so I''m really happy with it<br/> <br/>Post proccessing<br/>- Adjust clarity, contrast, red saturation, yellow hue<br/>- Sharpening<br/>- Noise reduction<br/>- Resize</td>', 'Thank you all for the votes and great comments!!I''m glad you liked the photoThe score really started like a rocket, clearly above 7Later went down... later up again... finally downAt some moment I felt like watching some stock quotation!This is my best score so far, so I''m really happy with it Post proccessing- Adjust clarity, contrast, red saturation, yellow hue- Sharpening- Noise reduction- Resize', '2012-01-16 02:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
