(6646453, 991448, 11854, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Top 15 isn''t bad. ;D</td>', 'Beautiful! Top 15 isn''t bad. ;D', '2012-01-16 10:30:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6646469, 991874, 64086, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo Ben. The shallow focus is well placed. It''s an interesting composition. It has nice tones and deep blacks. I believe it has emotional impact too. I think it''s irrelevant whether you know that radio flyers are red in color(although I''m sure many that did know and still gave you a low score). If this had been a mono photo of a telephone box, and I enjoyed it, I would have scored it highly too. I would give the photographer the benefit of the doubt assuming that they "saw" the photo as red when they made it. It''s a shame people are so narrow minded. Sometimes you have to look beyond what is presented to you.</td>', 'Very nice photo Ben. The shallow focus is well placed. It''s an interesting composition. It has nice tones and deep blacks. I believe it has emotional impact too. I think it''s irrelevant whether you know that radio flyers are red in color(although I''m sure many that did know and still gave you a low score). If this had been a mono photo of a telephone box, and I enjoyed it, I would have scored it highly too. I would give the photographer the benefit of the doubt assuming that they "saw" the photo as red when they made it. It''s a shame people are so narrow minded. Sometimes you have to look beyond what is presented to you.', '2012-01-16 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 0),
